DESCRIPTION >
    Product events from the Wayfare API. user_hash is a salted hash; no PII is stored.

SCHEMA >
    `timestamp` DateTime64(3) `json:$.timestamp`,
    `event` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.event`,
    `user_hash` String `json:$.user_hash`,
    `props` String `json:$.props`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_PARTITION_KEY "toYYYYMM(timestamp)"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "event, timestamp"
ENGINE_TTL "toDateTime(timestamp) + INTERVAL 13 MONTH"
